          <h2 style="margin:0;max-width:820px;font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,54px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:#1C130E;text-wrap:balance"><span style="font-weight:400">See your own catalog matched </span><span style="font-weight:700">against your competitors</span></h2>
          <p style="margin:0;max-width:560px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#3A302A">Bring a product list, and the demo shows your prices next to your competitors'.</p>
          <a href="/book-a-demo" style="height:50px;padding:0 24px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F2421B 0%,#F7631E 50%,#FB8A2E 100%);color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Geist,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 12px 26px -12px rgba(247,99,30,.85)">Book a Demo</a>
        </div>
